_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_

**Replace empty catch block with error logging.**

The empty catch block on Line 37 silently swallows all errors, making debugging difficult. Even for non-critical telemetry code, consider logging errors to aid development and troubleshooting.



<details>
<summary>📝 Proposed fix to add error logging</summary>

```diff
